## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

Make sure you have these installed:

- **Python** 3.10 or higher — [Download](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
- **Node.js** 18+ and **npm** — [Download](https://nodejs.org/)
- **Git** — [Download](https://git-scm.com/)
- **Google Gemini API Key** — [Get free key](https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey)

> ⚠️ **No GPU required** — this project runs entirely on CPU.

---

### 🔧 Installation

#### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/vishakha2121/multi-agent-chip-design-assistant.git
cd multi-agent-chip-design-assistant
```

#### 2. Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv

# Activate it
# Windows:
venv\Scripts\activate
# Mac/Linux:
source venv/bin/activate

# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

#### 3. Configure Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the `backend/` folder:

```env
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./chip_design.db
SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here
BACKEND_HOST=127.0.0.1
BACKEND_PORT=8000
```

> 💡 Copy from `.env.example` and fill in your real Gemini key.

#### 4. Initialize the Database

```bash
python database/init_db.py
```

This creates `chip_design.db` with all tables.

#### 5. Run the Backend

```bash
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
```

Backend will be live at: **http://127.0.0.1:8000**
API docs at: **http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs** (Swagger UI)

#### 6. Frontend Setup

Open a **new terminal**:

```bash
cd frontend

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Create .env file
echo "VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000" > .env

# Start dev server
npm run dev
```

Frontend will be live at: **http://localhost:5173**

---

### 🎯 Quick Test

1. Open **http://localhost:5173** in your browser
2. Click **"New Design"**
3. Enter chip specs, e.g.:

   ```
   Chip Type:        8-bit RISC CPU
   Target Frequency: 500 MHz
   Target Area:      5 mm²
   Technology Node:  45nm
   ```

4. Click **"Start Design"**
5. Watch the **5 agents** collaborate live on the dashboard 🎉

---

## 🔌 API Endpoints

### Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/auth/register` | Register new user |
| POST | `/api/auth/login` | Login and get JWT token |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user |

### Projects

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/projects` | List all projects |
| POST | `/api/projects` | Create new project |
| GET | `/api/projects/{id}` | Get project details |
| DELETE | `/api/projects/{id}` | Delete project |

### Chip Design

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/api/design/start` | Start multi-agent design run |
| GET | `/api/design/{id}` | Get design result |
| GET | `/api/design/{id}/logs` | Agent execution logs |

### Agents

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/agents` | List all agents |
| GET | `/api/agents/{name}/status` | Agent status |
| GET | `/api/agents/{name}/messages` | Agent conversation |

### Layout / Timing / Routing / Cost

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/layout/{design_id}` | Layout data |
| GET | `/api/timing/{design_id}` | Timing report |
| GET | `/api/routing/{design_id}` | Routing report |
| GET | `/api/cost/{design_id}` | Cost breakdown |

### WebSocket

| Endpoint | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `ws://127.0.0.1:8000/ws/agents/{design_id}` | Live agent updates |

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `users` | User authentication |
| `projects` | Chip design projects |
| `chip_designs` | Design specifications |
| `agents` | Registered agent metadata |
| `agent_logs` | Step-by-step agent logs |
| `agent_messages` | Inter-agent communication |
| `layouts` | Placement & floorplan results |
| `timing_reports` | STA slack & violations |
| `routing_reports` | DRC & congestion data |
| `cost_estimates` | Manufacturing cost breakdown |
| `optimization_runs` | GNN / GA optimization history |

---

