# 🧠 SiliconMind — Multi-Agent AI Chip Design Assistant

<div align="center">

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-3776AB?style=for-the-badge&logo=python&logoColor=white)
![FastAPI](https://img.shields.io/badge/FastAPI-0.109-009688?style=for-the-badge&logo=fastapi&logoColor=white)
![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-18-61DAFB?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=black)
![Vite](https://img.shields.io/badge/Vite-5-646CFF?style=for-the-badge&logo=vite&logoColor=white)
![TailwindCSS](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind-3-06B6D4?style=for-the-badge&logo=tailwindcss&logoColor=white)
![PyTorch](https://img.shields.io/badge/PyTorch-CPU-EE4C2C?style=for-the-badge&logo=pytorch&logoColor=white)
![Gemini](https://img.shields.io/badge/Google-Gemini-4285F4?style=for-the-badge&logo=google&logoColor=white)
![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-3-003B57?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green?style=for-the-badge)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Active%20Development-yellow?style=for-the-badge)

**Five intelligent agents. One mission: design better chips, faster.**

An AI-powered multi-agent system that collaboratively automates the complete ASIC / AI chip design flow — from RTL specification to manufacturing cost estimation.

[Features](#-features) • [Architecture](#-architecture) • [Tech Stack](#-tech-stack) • [Getting Started](#-getting-started) • [API](#-api-endpoints) • [Roadmap](#-roadmap) • [License](#-license)

</div>

---

## 📖 Overview

**SiliconMind** is a full-stack, multi-agent AI framework that simulates a real-world chip design team. Instead of a single monolithic AI, it uses **five specialized agents** that talk to each other, share feedback, and iteratively refine a chip design — much like how human EDA engineers collaborate.

Each agent is powered by a combination of:

- 🧠 **Google Gemini** — LLM reasoning for design decisions
- 🕸️ **Graph Neural Networks** — Layout optimization on chip netlists
- ⚙️ **Heuristic Optimization** — Genetic Algorithms + Simulated Annealing

The result is a **live, interactive dashboard** where you can watch agents collaborate in real time, visualize layouts, analyze timing violations, detect routing congestion, and estimate manufacturing costs.

> 💡 **Runs entirely on CPU** — no GPU required. Perfect for learning and portfolio projects.

---

## ✨ Features

### 🤖 Five Specialized AI Agents

| Agent | Responsibility | Powered By |
|-------|---------------|------------|
| 🏗️ **Design Agent** | Generates RTL module structure from high-level chip specs | Gemini LLM |
| 📐 **Layout Agent** | Optimizes cell placement & floorplanning | GNN + Gemini |
| ⏱️ **Timing Agent** | Performs Static Timing Analysis (setup/hold slack) | Gemini + Rules |
| 🔀 **Routing Agent** | Detects DRC violations & congestion hotspots | Gemini + Graph |
| 💰 **Cost Agent** | Estimates wafer, die, and yield-based costs | Gemini + ML |

### 🎛️ Core Capabilities

- ✅ **Multi-Agent Orchestration** — Agents communicate via a message bus with feedback loops
- ✅ **Real-Time Updates** — WebSocket-driven live agent logs & status
- ✅ **Graph Neural Networks** — Chip netlist represented as a graph for placement optimization
- ✅ **Optimization Algorithms** — Genetic Algorithm & Simulated Annealing for layout/cost
- ✅ **Full-Stack Dashboard** — Interactive React UI with charts, heatmaps, and network graphs
- ✅ **Project History** — Every design run stored and retrievable from SQLite
- ✅ **Agent Conversation Viewer** — See exactly how agents reason and reply to each other
- ✅ **Modular Architecture** — Clean separation: routes → services → agents → AI/ML

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

### High-Level Flow

```
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │   React Frontend    │
                    │  (Dashboard + UI)   │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │ REST + WebSocket
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │   FastAPI Backend   │
                    │  (Routes + Services)│
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
                               ▼
                    ┌─────────────────────┐
                    │    Orchestrator     │
                    │  (Agent Controller) │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               │
        ┌──────────────────────┼──────────────────────┐
        ▼                      ▼                      ▼
 ┌────────────┐        ┌────────────┐        ┌────────────┐
 │  Design    │───────▶│  Layout    │───────▶│  Timing    │
 │  Agent     │        │  Agent     │        │  Agent     │
 └────────────┘        └────────────┘        └────────────┘
        │                      │                      │
        │                      ▼                      │
        │              ┌────────────┐                 │
        │              │  Routing   │◀────────────────┘
        │              │  Agent     │
        │              └────────────┘
        │                      │
        ▼                      ▼
 ┌──────────────────────────────────┐
 │         Cost Agent               │
 └──────────────────────────────────┘
                │
                ▼
       Final Design Report
```

### Agent Collaboration Loop

```
User Input (Chip Spec)
        │
        ▼
  [Design Agent]  ──▶  RTL structure
        │
        ▼
  [Layout Agent]  ──▶  Optimized placement (GNN)
        │
        ▼
  [Timing Agent]  ──▶  Slack analysis
        │
        ├─── Violations? ──▶ Feedback to Layout Agent (loop)
        │
        ▼
  [Routing Agent] ──▶  DRC + congestion report
        │
        ▼
  [Cost Agent]    ──▶  Wafer / die / yield cost estimate
        │
        ▼
   Final Report → Frontend (WebSocket live push)
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- **Python 3.10+** — Core language
- **FastAPI** — High-performance async web framework
- **SQLAlchemy** — ORM for SQLite
- **Pydantic** — Data validation
- **Uvicorn** — ASGI server
- **WebSockets** — Real-time agent updates

### AI / ML
- **Google Gemini API** (`gemini-1.5-flash`) — LLM reasoning
- **PyTorch (CPU)** — Deep learning
- **PyTorch Geometric** — Graph Neural Networks
- **NumPy / Pandas** — Data processing
- **Scikit-learn** — Feature engineering

### Frontend
- **React 18** + **Vite** — Fast modern SPA
- **TailwindCSS** — Utility-first styling
- **React Router** — Client-side routing
- **Axios** — HTTP client
- **Recharts / Chart.js** — Data visualization
- **React Flow** — Graph / network visualization
- **Framer Motion** — Smooth animations

### Database
- **SQLite** — Lightweight, zero-config relational DB

### DevOps
- **Git** + **GitHub** — Version control
- **Docker** *(optional)* — Containerization

