📄 Complete .gitignore File — Copy-Paste Ready
Bhai, ye tera complete .gitignore hai. Isko as-is copy karke apne project ke root folder mein .gitignore naam se save kar de. Ye file ensure karegi ki node_modules, venv, .env, *.db jaisi files GitHub pe accidentally upload na ho. 🚀

